error[E4028]: cannot capture the variable 'n' by value
  --> main.prism:8:21
    8 |     return Button({ n += 1; n })
      |                     ^
  --> main.prism:8:19
    8 |     return Button({ n += 1; n })
      |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the closure owns its captures because it is stored in a field here
   = note: a closure that owns its captures would keep the value 'n' had when it was built, and not see later writes to the 'var'
   = help: the closure writes 'n', and a closure cannot write what it owns: keep it from escaping, so that it borrows 'n'
